  "body": "Positioned in a peaceful cul-de-sac, this brand-new residence presents an exceptional opportunity to experience refined contemporary living in one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal communities. With an impressive 452sqm floor area on approximately 501sqm of land, space and sophistication are beautifully brought together.\r\n\r\nInside, every detail has been thoughtfully considered. The designer kitchen, complete with premium appliances, an impressive cooktop and built-in oven, forms the heart of the home - equally suited to everyday family life and sophisticated entertaining. Multiple living areas create an effortless sense of space, while the additional lounge upstairs provides the perfect retreat for movie nights, children's play, or relaxed gatherings.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is equally impressive, with six bedrooms and five bathrooms, including an exceptionally generous master suite designed as a private sanctuary. With its generous proportions and carefully considered layout, the home offers outstanding flexibility for families, guests and multi-generational living.\r\n\r\nAnd then there is the lifestyle. Enjoy the best of Long Bay with the beach and regional park close by, while New World, cafés, shops and everyday amenities are within an easy walk, making daily life wonderfully convenient. Add the appeal of sought-after local schooling, including Long Bay School and Long Bay College, and the location becomes especially compelling for families.\r\n\r\nA home of remarkable scale, sophisticated design and effortless convenience - where coastal living meets elevated family life.\r\n\r\nThis is more than a new home. It is a lifestyle waiting to be lived.",
